{"n": 124, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "124.webp", "text": "11-104\n\nDisconnect both oll cooler hoses on\nthe oll fliter housing.\n\nRemove fan - see 11 52 000.\nRemove radiator - see Gr. 17.\nDisconnect ground lead on oll pan.\nInstallation.\n\nTightening torque for oll cooler hose\ncoupling nuts: 35 Nm (25 ft. Ibs.).\n\nUnscrew power steering pump on\nholder (hydraulic hoses remain\nconnected) and suspend It from car\naside with a piece of wire.\n\nInstallation:\n\nTighten drive belt and check tightness\nwith Special Too! 11 5 021.\n\nUnscrew air conditioner compressor\non holder (refrigerant hoses remain\nconnected) and suspend It from car\naside with a plece of wire.\n\nInstallation:\n\nTighten drive belt and check tightness\nwith Special Too! 11 5 021.\n\nDisconnect support and gas pressure\nPtup, and prop up engine hood with\nSpecial Tool 51 2 120.\n\nCaution!\n\nUse retainer (1),\n\nInstallation\n\nInsert plastic part (2).\n\nUnscrew engine mounts on front axie\ncarrier,\n\nleft - unscrew at lop\nloosen al bottom\nright - loosen al top\nunscrew al bottom\nInstallation\n\nTightening torque: 45 Nm (32.5 ft. Ibs.)\n\nAttach Special Too! 11 0 000 on engine\nand lift oul engine.", "words": [["11-104", 0.4681, 0.0358, 0.536, 0.059], ["Disconnect", 0.2766, 0.0749, 0.3369, 0.0862], ["both", 0.3414, 0.0756, 0.3647, 0.0869], ["oll", 0.3688, 0.0756, 0.381, 0.0869], ["cooler", 0.3855, 0.0763, 0.4184, 0.0869], ["hoses", 0.4235, 0.0763, 0.4549, 0.0869], ["on", 0.459, 0.0782, 0.4721, 0.0869], ["the", 0.2761, 0.0915, 0.2928, 0.1034], ["oll", 0.2964, 0.0922, 0.309, 0.1034], ["fliter", 0.3136, 0.0915, 0.3379, 0.1034], ["housing.", 0.3419, 0.0922, 0.3875, 0.1068], ["Remove", 0.2766, 0.1088, 0.3202, 0.1207], ["fan", 0.3242, 0.1088, 0.3404, 0.1207], ["-", 0.3445, 0.1141, 0.3475, 0.1167], ["see", 0.3516, 0.1114, 0.3698, 0.1207], ["11", 0.3749, 0.1101, 0.3845, 0.12], ["52", 0.3901, 0.1088, 0.4022, 0.1207], ["000.", 0.4063, 0.1094, 0.4271, 0.1207], ["Remove", 0.2766, 0.1247, 0.3202